          "suggested_revision": "Replace this with a section-specific account of the distinctions actually preserved here: cleaning and fitting rejected stones, disposal of unsuitable stones, interior/exterior placement, the two-day interval, mandatory cleanup, and the consequences of the master’s unexpected arrival. If the existing statement is intended as a multi-section summary, label its scope and provide the relevant section references. Review the replacement afresh.",
